# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Battle of Hillsbrad parts 3 to 5 (529, 532, 539), Dangerous! (567) and Elixir of Agony (509, then 513 to
# Faranell) wait for the Tarren Mill visit at about 30 in forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills (0.4.0
# level tidy, agreed with the 30-40 slice): Blacksmith Verringtan (26) and his apprentices in a dense smithy,
# Dangerous! (level 28) and the Mudsnout gnolls (27-28, shamans) were two to four levels over the players here.
# Left out: Scout Support and Valuable Vantages (98094, 98095): the western vial goes on the peak top on the
# Alterac border among Ferocious Yetis (31-32, recorded deaths), five levels up here and still over at 30.

# Horde 12-30 in the order the quest levels fit (2026-11-07): Hillsbrad at 22-24, between the first
# Ashenvale visit and the Barrens' and Stonetalon's level 23-27 quests (forever/horde/04-the-barrens).
#
# Flow: Tarren Mill (flight path, bind) -> the hills west of town and Hillsbrad Fields, the lions on
# the way back -> Tarren Mill -> Stanley and the peasants -> Tarren Mill -> Durnholde Keep -> Tarren
# Mill -> fly to the Sepulcher (Allister: Beren's Peril, Watching the
# Roads) -> the Undercity (training) -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar and its wind rider master, where the next
# guide flies on to Thunder Bluff. Tauren and Skyborne Druids with Trial of the Sea Lion go from the Undercity to
# Moonglade, Thunder Bluff and the Crossroads instead.
#
# Elixir of Agony (515) is not taken here: it needs a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir (3388), an Alchemy potion no
# vendor sells, and its hand-in waits for the Hillsbrad coast in forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills,
# whose opening Undercity stop offers it to a player who carries the elixir.
#
# Class quests: Shamans fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well beside the inn (Call of Water,
# 1536); Undead Priests hand Dark Sacrifice (5646) to Aelthalyste in the Undercity; Rogues learn
# Poisons from Serge Hinott (2479, 2480, optional, after Mission: Possible But Not Probable). Tauren
# Druids carry Trial of the Sea Lion (30) from forever/horde/02-the-barrens with both half pendants
# (the Sludge Fen's, and Silverpine's from the ride in forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains; its
# lockbox gives the half only while the quest is in the log, #1386): from the Undercity they cast
# Teleport: Moonglade, join the pendant at the Shrine of Remulos, hand it to Dendrite Starblaze,
# take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff for Aquatic Form (31) and training at Turak
# Runetotem, and fly on to the Crossroads, where the next guide starts, in place of the zeppelin.

step Beren's Peril
  when subzone "Beren's Peril"
  when onquest 516
  when !complete 516
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip If you're already at the cave, finish the Ravenclaws here. Pull them away from the elite spirit by the Offering Stone.
  kill 1974 quest 516.1
  kill 1973 quest 516.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  tip Tarren Mill is your base for this guide: you come back here between each loop. Everyone stands around the town square.
  getfp "Tarren Mill"
  collect 7771 quest 1536 only Shaman -- Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well beside the inn
  accept 501
  accept 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  turnin 493                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  turnin 1065                         -- Apothecary Lydon: Zamah's note
  accept 1066                         -- Apothecary Lydon: the vials come from the Syndicate Shadow Mages on the way to Durnholde
  turnin 494                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 549                          -- The WANTED poster by the inn
  accept 498                          -- Krusk, inside
  sethome "Tarren Mill" npc 2388      -- Innkeeper Shay

step Serge Hinott
  only Rogue
  tip After returning Mission: Possible But Not Probable to Shenthul, bring Hinott's Assistance to Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill. Stay beside him until the brewing objective completes, then hand in the follow-up to learn Poisons. Finish it even if the Zanzil poison has already been removed; removing the debuff alone does not teach the skill.
  turnin 2479                         -- Serge Hinott
  accept 2480 optional
  complete 2480 optional
  turnin 2480 optional                -- Serge Hinott: Poisons
  note "Poison chain unfinished? Resume your current stage in the Class guide Poisons (Horde); completed quests do not need restarting. Arrange a group for Gallywix, finish the Hinott follow-up, then return to this leveling guide."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: the hills and Hillsbrad Fields

step Bears, creepers and lions
  tip West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears, Forest Moss Creepers and Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one.
  collect 3476 quest 496.1 @54.3,39.6
  collect 3477 quest 496.2

step Hillsbrad Fields
  tip The farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere. Farmer Kalaba tends the field south of the farms. Careful: Kirin Tor Guards (55) stand north of the farms, on the road up toward Alterac: keep to the fields.
  kill 2266 quest 527.1
  kill 2360 quest 527.2
  kill 232 quest 527.3
  kill 2403 quest 527.4

step Mountain Lion Blood
  tip Careful: When one lion is attacked, nearby lions come to its aid, and the Vicious Black Bears sharing those fields can also join the fight.
  collect 3496 quest 501.1 @54.3,39.6

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 528
  accept 546                          -- Deathguard Samsa
  turnin 501                          -- Apothecary Lydon, inside
  accept 502
  turnin 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon, inside
  accept 499
  turnin 499                          -- Umpi, next to Lydon; inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: Stanley, peasants and skulls

step Stanley
  tip Stanley is Farmer Ray's dog, at the northern farmhouse in Hillsbrad Fields. If you are below level 24, leave the southern peasants for your next Hillsbrad visit. Turn in any finished errands at Tarren Mill.
  turnin 502

step Hillsbrad Fields: kill these as you meet them
  when level>=24
  when onquest 528,546
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Peasants work the southern fields, south-east of Hillsbrad town. Every Hillsbrad human drops skulls; the Peasants drop them most often, so work the fields and stay out of the town square.
  tip Careful: Snare fleeing peasants before they reach the town hall and bring back footmen. Councilmen (24-26) hold the square, Magistrate Burnside (30) stands in the hall, and Kirin Tor Guards (55) guard the road north toward Alterac.
  loop
  goto 35.2,46.4 map 1424 era
  goto 36.44,45.43 map 1424 era
  goto 35.59,44.31 map 1424 era
  collect 3692 quest 546.1 -- Hillsbrad Human Skull: the Peasants in the southern fields
  kill 2267 quest 528.1

step Tarren Mill
  when complete 528
  turnin 528                          -- High Executor Darthalia

step Tarren Mill
  when complete 546
  turnin 546                          -- Deathguard Samsa
  note Darthalia's next Battle of Hillsbrad and Lydon's Elixir of Agony are for the next visit, at about 30.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East: Durnholde
step Durnholde Keep: kill these as you meet them
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Drull and Tog'thar are chained inside Durnholde Keep's courtyard buildings. Jailor Eston carries the Dull Iron Key and Jailor Marlgen the Burnished Gold Key. You only need the key for a lock that is still closed.
  tip From Tarren Mill go south-east into the hills on the way to Durnholde Keep. Rogues, Watchmen and Shadow Mages hold the camps along the way; the Shadow Mages carry Lydon's Vials of Innocent Blood.
  kill 2260 quest 549.1
  kill 2261 quest 549.2               -- Syndicate Watchman walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  collect 5620 quest 1066.1           -- Vial of Innocent Blood, from the Syndicate Shadow Mages

step Jailor Eston
  when onquest 498
  when !done drull-freed
  collect 3467                        -- Dull Iron Key, from Jailor Eston

step Jailor Marlgen
  when onquest 498
  when !done togthar-freed
  collect 3499                        -- Burnished Gold Key, from Jailor Marlgen

step Free Tog'thar
  label togthar-freed
  when onquest 498
  interact 1722 quest 498.2           -- Tog'thar's ball and chain

step Free Drull
  label drull-freed
  when onquest 498
  interact 1721 quest 498.1           -- Drull's ball and chain

step Tarren Mill
  turnin 498                          -- Krusk, inside
  turnin 549                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  turnin 1066                         -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 1067                         -- Apothecary Lydon: his toxin is for Apothecary Zamah, on the Barrens & Stonetalon guide's Thunder Bluff stop

step The Sepulcher
  when complete 95981
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip From Tarren Mill, take the bat to the Sepulcher. Shadow Priest Allister stands by the crypt entrance.
  fly "The Sepulcher"
  turnin 95981                        -- Shadow Priest Allister
  note Still need Ravenclaw Guardians or Drudgers? They are in the cave at Beren's Peril, south-east of Ambermill. You don't need to go back there to collect Allister's other rewards.

step Shadow Priest Allister
  when complete 479
  zone Silverpine Forest
  turnin 479                          -- Shadow Priest Allister: Ambermill's pendants

step Shadow Priest Allister
  when complete 516
  zone Silverpine Forest
  turnin 516                          -- Shadow Priest Allister

step Fly to the Undercity
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Fly to the Undercity. At the Sepulcher, Karos Razok is just east of the crypt. If you have no business there, take the bat straight from Tarren Mill.
  fly "Undercity"
  zone Undercity

step Aelthalyste
  only Undead,Priest
  tip Aelthalyste stands in the War Quarter.
  turnin 5646 only Undead -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity
step The Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip Train and restock in the Undercity before the zeppelin.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest

step Archibald
  only Warrior
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Warrior
  zone Undercity
  when level>=20
  when money>=1g
  when !skill "Polearms" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Paladin
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Hunter
  zone Undercity
  when level>=20
  when money>=1g
  when !skill "Polearms" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Rogue
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren and Skyborne Druids: Aquatic Form
# Three steps, so no step's `when` turns false before its last goal is done: the hand-in of 30
# ends the first, the hand-in of 31 the second, and the third holds only in Thunder Bluff.
step Trial of the Sea Lion
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  when onquest 30
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Join the two pendant halves at the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, before you see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  collect 15885 quest 30.1              -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: use a half at the Shrine of Remulos
  turnin 30                             -- Dendrite Starblaze

step Aquatic Form
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  when turnedin 30
  when !turnedin 31
  tip Take Aquatic Form from Dendrite Starblaze, who stands upstairs in his building. Then Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise.
  accept 31                             -- Dendrite Starblaze
  fly "Thunder Bluff"                   -- Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there
  turnin 31                             -- Turak Runetotem: Aquatic Form

step Back to the Crossroads
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  tip Train with Turak Runetotem. Apothecary Zamah, in the Pools of Vision under Spirit Rise, takes Lydon's toxin if you carry it. Before you fly on, Tah Winterhoof and Zangen Stonehoof, a short walk east of the wind rider master, give two quests worked on the next guides' walks; then fly on to the Crossroads, where the next guide starts.
  train class
  turnin 1067                         -- Apothecary Zamah, Pools of Vision
  accept 1086                         -- Apothecary Zamah: the Toxic Fogger, for Windshear Crag in the next guide
  accept 97538                        -- Tah Winterhoof: Pigments for Paints, the Mirkweed in Mirkfallon Lake by Sun Rock
  accept 1195 optional                -- Zangen Stonehoof: The Sacred Flame, the phial from Ashenvale's Laughing Sisters
  fly "Crossroads"

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when !turnedin 31
  goto 60.7,58.9 "Zeppelin to Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  when !turnedin 31
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"

step Orgrimmar
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train before you fly on: the next guide flies from here.
  train class
